    "id": 3522881,
    "postDate": "2026-09-09T22:37:30.860Z",
    "rawMarkdown": "My latest submission that I have been working is a single fold, 0.941 at 23 minutes\nMy prior was a 5 fold at 0.939 scoring in 5 hours",
    "content": "<p>My latest submission that I have been working is a single fold, 0.941 at 23 minutes\nMy prior was a 5 fold at 0.939 scoring in 5 hours</p>",
    "replies": [
     {
      "id": 3522923,
      "postDate": "2026-09-10T01:08:36.983Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Appreciate the info. My 5-fold inference runs in ~30 mins, and a single fold is around 20–30 mins. Seems like preprocessing is the main bottleneck in my situation.",
      "content": "<p>Appreciate the info. My 5-fold inference runs in ~30 mins, and a single fold is around 20–30 mins. Seems like preprocessing is the main bottleneck in my situation.</p>",
